      "content": "it's not just about needing a break though. it's like... everything is just so heavy. i look at the skyline and all i see is a cage. i don't want to \"reset,\" i just want the noise to actually stop. i want it to be quiet. permanently. it feels like the only way to actually be free from the cycle is to just... not be part of it anymore. does that even make sense?",
